OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,6,Fshowery rain in places, this clearing
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter during the afternoon, with
OL,9,Fplenty of sunshine. Breezier but still
OL,10,Fwarm with temperatures above average
OL,11,Ffor the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry to start but rain moves
OL,14,Fin from the west. Mostly light but
OL,15,Fturning showery into the early hours.
OL,16,FShowers ease by dawn becoming
OL,17,Fisolated. Feeling fresher and less
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
