OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FIsolated showers remain
OL,6,Fthrough the day, but most places
OL,7,Fstaying dry with bright and sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Temperatures around average
OL,9,Ffor the time of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fnortherly wind develops for the next
OL,13,Ffew days, allowing temperatures to
OL,14,Fdrop below average. Thunder showers
OL,15,Ffor Thursday and Friday, but brighter
OL,16,Fand drier for Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
